    <string name="about_purpose_text">Fullscreen3D is a 3D photos and videos viewer for a stereoscopic 3D monitor or beamer.\nMain features : \n - SBS (side by side JPEG, full or half width) and MPO picture viewer, \n - half width side by side video viewer \n - auto and manual alignment, \n - cropping, \n - stereo issues spotting, \n - EXIF data enrichment</string>
